OL,4,CPolice investigate death of boy, 3,    
OL,5,Cafter nursery incident                 
OL,6,GAn investigation has been launched     
OL,7,Ginto the death of a three-year-old boy 
OL,8,Gfollowing an incident at a nursery in  
OL,9,GGreater Manchester, police said.       
OL,11,FThe boy became critically ill at Cosy  
OL,12,FToes Nursery in Middleton shortly      
OL,13,Fbefore 16:00 GMT on Monday 2 November. 
OL,15,FHe was rushed to hospital, where he    
OL,16,Fdied three days later.                 
OL,18,FGreater Manchester Police said his     
OL,19,Ffamily were being supported by         
OL,20,Fspecialist officers.                   
